<title>BELGIUM: Creyf's 1996 profit edges up.</title>
<headline>Creyf's 1996 profit edges up.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit (less minorities)		  143 vs 141</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)				    25 vs 25</p>
<p>    Cons net profit					   170 vs 155</p>
<p>    Cons current profit before goodwill writedowns  331 vs 302</p>
<p>    Goodwill writedowns					25 vs 20</p>
<p>    Cons turnover					   8,848 vs 7,677</p>
<p>    Non-cons net profit					28 vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Creyf's NV is a Belgian temporary employment company.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
